rrently moulin rouge is the only west  end show that requires you to agree to  wear a mask at booking and cabaret  demands lateral flow tests before entry  the theatre industry has a long way to  go to get over the catastrophic  financial impact it's endured for lord  lloyd webber the curtain is now finally  up and while he can he wants to support  those causes close to his heart katie  spencer sky news
 

